efault", "desc": "Bug 1776760 - Enable dFPI by default for Beta and Release via cookieBehavior pref. r=anti-tracking-reviewers,timhuang, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150596", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "8810d7adfd25e1b9f87506291bf409842c2c78ba", "parents": ["0655f367d2bfe7324c6da708d58796e2c10901dd"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sebastian Hengst \u003carchaeopteryx@coole-files.de\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1777501 - drop wpt rules which assume dFPI is disabled outside Nightly. r=timhuang, a=test-only\n\ndFPI has been enabled in bug 1776760. dFPI for ServiceWorkers remains restricted\nto Nightly, see bug 1730885.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150826", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/IndexedDB/idb-partitioned-basic.tentative.sub.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/service-workers/service-worker/partitioned-claim.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/service-workers/service-worker/partitioned-getRegistrations.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/service-workers/service-worker/partitioned-matchAll.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/service-workers/service-worker/partitioned.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/web-locks/partitioned-web-locks.tentative.https.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/webmessaging/broadcastchannel/cross-partition.https.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/webstorage/localstorage-about-blank-3P-iframe-opens-3P-window.partitioned.tentative.html.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "21ee71f0f88f835931d040e2826d954b7c9ae993", "parents": ["8810d7adfd25e1b9f87506291bf409842c2c78ba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Zuehlcke \u003cpbz@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1777513 - Grant first-party storage access to allow service worker to run in test frame. r=anti-tracking-reviewers,timhuang, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150957", "files": ["netwerk/test/mochitests/test_1502055.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c58bbcaeab880f132e04903398a9de7bea3b23f4", "parents": ["21ee71f0f88f835931d040e2826d954b7c9ae993"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jonathan Kew \u003cjkew@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1777332 - Ensure the Mac font registration thread gets a chance to finish. r=gsvelto,application-update-reviewers,nalexander, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150869", "files": ["toolkit/xre/nsUpdateDriver.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7de37cd3dedec9fd7412b0bfee994f71395e08c1", "parents": ["c58bbcaeab880f132e04903398a9de7bea3b23f4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1778444 - Clear UISettings on shutdown (esr). r=kaie, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D151314", "files": ["widget/windows/WindowsUIUtils.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0b455b86c5606ced75670093d88c205e7fc63fa7", "parents": ["7de37cd3dedec9fd7412b0bfee994f71395e08c1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1777296 - [devtools] Bail out of getAddonIdForWindowGlobal for geckoview windowglobals missing principal r=ochameau, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D151177", "files": ["devtools/server/actors/watcher/browsing-context-helpers.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a5dab5ec3371a5f644037fadc5051edaa859538e", "parents": ["0b455b86c5606ced75670093d88c205e7fc63fa7"], "tags": []}], "date": 1657738832, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "32": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Chevobbe \u003cnchevobbe@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1773879 - [devtools] Fix Copy all Message context menu action in Browser Console. r=jdescottes, a=dmeehan\n\nWe don't have a toolbox in the Browser Console, so we don't\nneed to have a Provider for its store.\nA simple test is added, just checking that the action was\ntriggered.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D149593", "files": ["devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/_browser_console.ini", "devtools/client/webconsole/test/browser/browser_console_context_menu_export_console_output.js", "devtools/client/webconsole/utils/context-menu.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5e7127b2ba456a0e6050b416096e637cd801348a", "parents": ["a5dab5ec3371a5f644037fadc5051edaa859538e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1774378 - Make select code harder to mess up. r=Gijs, a=dmeehan\n\nRight now we rely on the menulist to be injected by hand in all the\nrelevant windows. Instead create it lazily, making the select code more\nstandalone.\n\nThe DevTools window was missing it, for example.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D149620", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser.xhtml", "browser/base/content/main-popupset.inc.xhtml", "browser/base/content/tabbrowser.js", "browser/base/content/test/forms/browser_selectpopup.js", "browser/base/content/test/forms/browser_selectpopup_colors.js", "browser/base/content/test/forms/browser_selectpopup_searchfocus.js", "browser/base/content/test/forms/head.js", "browser/base/content/test/tabdialogs/browser_subdialog_esc.js", "browser/base/content/webext-panels.js", "browser/base/content/webext-panels.xhtml", "browser/components/extensions/ExtensionPopups.jsm", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_popup_select.js", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_popup_select_in_oopif.js", "devtools/client/framework/test/browser_webextension_dropdown.js", "devtools/client/framework/toolbox-hosts.js", "gfx/layers/apz/test/mochitest/browser_test_select_popup_position.js", "gfx/layers/apz/test/mochitest/browser_test_select_zoom.js", "gfx/layers/apz/test/mochitest/helper_browser_test_utils.js", "layout/base/tests/browser_select_popup_position_in_out_of_process_iframe.js", "testing/mochitest/BrowserTestUtils/BrowserTestUtils.jsm", "toolkit/actors/SelectParent.jsm", "toolkit/components/printing/content/print.js", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser_destination_change.js", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser_print_duplex.js", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser_print_page_range.js", "toolkit/components/printing/tests/browser_sheet_count.js", "toolkit/content/widgets/browser-custom-element.js", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.html", "toolkit/mozapps/extensions/content/aboutaddons.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cfe524975e838a2d891ea5d79514fbab78592420", "parents": ["5e7127b2ba456a0e6050b416096e637cd801348a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1771774, r=kershaw, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150457", "files": ["modules/libjar/nsJARChannel.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a2adccae05a40762834463546138bd7f7409220e", "parents": ["cfe524975e838a2d891ea5d79514fbab78592420"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Schuster \u003ctschuster@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1762520 - Update preload SRI checking for HTML spec change. r=freddyb, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150955", "files": ["dom/security/SRIMetadata.cpp", "dom/security/SRIMetadata.h", "testing/web-platform/meta/preload/subresource-integrity.html.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1d5021250f74b52f2dc73b6767392470f97c6c8b", "parents": ["a2adccae05a40762834463546138bd7f7409220e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Neil Deakin \u003cneil@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1773894, special-case some extensions when downloading them, r=Gijs, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150386", "files": ["uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalHelperAppService.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d10832fe6c6dc24c3121420fd4af3f8128e94191", "parents": ["1d5021250f74b52f2dc73b6767392470f97c6c8b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr102 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update, r=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D151816", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1489038533cd2697a6d81baedae05ff18f8afd8c", "parents": ["d10832fe6c6dc24c3121420fd4af3f8128e94191"], "tags": []}], "date": 1657807168, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "33": {"changesets": [{"author": "Brad Werth \u003cbwerth@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1761160: Disable spellechecking in the textarea for the blur-focus test. r=masayuki, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D150281", "files": ["editor/reftests/824080-6-ref.html", "editor/reftests/824080-6.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f426eeb43e02c291cfbb6395fe91b1d36064d9e0", "parents": ["1489038533cd2697a6d81baedae05ff18f8afd8c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Julian Descottes \u003cjdescottes@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1727207 - [marionette] Disable widget.gtk.overlay-scrollbars.enabled for test_reftest.py r=webdriver-reviewers,whimboo, a=test-only\n\nDisabling scrollbars fixes the intermittent, also removing the skip-if since it always evaluated to false anyway.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D148130", "files": ["testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/unit/test_reftest.py", "testing/marionette/harness/marionette_harness/tests/unit/unit-tests.ini"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "13466ea509d716aa843c2eb18e8c92fa25a9e11a", "parents": ["f426eeb43e02c291cfbb6395fe91b1d36064d9e0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Haik Aftandilian \u003chaftandilian@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1562756 - Code Injection in Firefox macOS desktop r=spohl, a=dmeehan\n\nDrop the com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables entitlement to disallow use of dyld environment variables in signed production builds.\n\nLeave the entitlement in for signed developer builds.\n\nFirefox gtests depend on the use of DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH. However, testing infrastructure does not run gtests on signed builds and therefore gtests are not impacted by this change. gtests could be run on signed developer builds in the future which will still allow dyld environment variables after this change.\n\nbrowser.production.entitlements.xml and plugin-container.production.entitlements.xml are not used, but being kept up to date.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D148324", "files": ["ipc/glue/GeckoChildProcessHost.cpp", "security/mac/hardenedruntime/browser.production.entitlements.xml", "security/mac/hardenedruntime/developer.entitlements.xml", "security/mac/hardenedruntime/plugin-container.production.entitlements.xml", "security/mac/hardenedruntime/production.entitlements.xml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "776235869217a7ab893551eb495f71a54a8dd029", "parents": ["13466ea509d716aa843c2eb18e8c92fa25a9e11a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Haik Aftandilian \u003chaftandilian@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1770484 - Make Mac processes not depend on DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH to load libraries r=glandium,gsvelto,mac-reviewers,necko-reviewers,dragana,spohl, a=dmeehan\n\nChange XUL and other dylibs to be built with an @rpath/\u003cdylib\u003e install name (LC_ID_DYLIB) instead of @executable_path/\u003cdylib\u003e.\n\nChange executables to be built with an @rpath dyld search path set to @executable_path by default so that @rpath/\u003cdylib\u003e dylibs in the same directory can be resolved. For executables not in the same directory as @rpath dylibs, such as plugin-container, set a relative @rpath such as @executable_path/../../../.\n\nPreviously, dylib install names were set as @executable_path/\u003cdylib\u003e allowing them to be resolved by dyld for the loading executable if the executable resided in the same directory as the dylib. For executables not in the same directory as the dylibs, dyld resolved these dylibs using DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH set before launching the process by Firefox code. With this change, loading does not rely on DYLD environment variables. Instead, dylibs have an install name set as @rpath/\u003cdylib\u003e and each executable loading a dylib has its @rpath set at compile-time to refer to dylib directory.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D147360", "files": ["config/rules.mk", "ipc/app/moz.build", "ipc/glue/GeckoChildProcessHost.cpp", "netwerk/test/http3server/moz.build", "toolkit/crashreporter/client/moz.build", "toolkit/crashreporter/nsExceptionHandler.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "dd4d355d7f5f77461c1b619998c84ae3e21283eb", "parents": ["776235869217a7ab893551eb495f71a54a8dd029"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1768809 - Fix library preloading for the OpenH264 plugin. r=media-playback-reviewers,alwu, a=dmeehan\n\nThe workaround added in bug 1725828 was intended to be applied to any\nplugin that may have been linked against a different version of glibc\nthan the browser; i.e., everything except clearkey, which is built and\nshipped along with the browser.  Unfortunately, the change was made in a\nfunction used only for the Widevine CDM, so we're now having the same\nproblem with OpenH264.  This patch corrects that oversight and preloads\nthe (potentially) needed libraries for every applicable plugin.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D149446", "files": ["dom/media/gmp/GMPParent.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "204247277dc85d2dc721c1af110f10020cd6a26c", "parents": ["dd4d355d7f5f77461c1b619998c84ae3e21283eb"], "tags": []}], "date": 1657818606, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "34": {"changesets": [{"author": "Niklas Baumgardner \u003cnbaumgardner@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1770390 - Check if take screenshot should show on frame. r=sfoster, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D147545", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-context.inc", "browser/base/content/nsContextMenu.js", "browser/base/content/test/contextMenu/browser_contextmenu.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "4de1cc393797422d172f42369ad5afcd3f85a6ab", "parents": ["204247277dc85d2dc721c1af110f10020cd6a26c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1737722. r=botond, a=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D145721", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/src/WRHitTester.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9ddbcae66c05d225db88d8ede7d0bb605a3c29a0", "parents": ["4de1cc393797422d172f42369ad5afcd3f85a6ab"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Neil Deakin \u003cneil@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1773907, don't clear the extension on the possible filename if we don't have one to replace it with, r=mhowell, a=dmeehan\n\nThe issue here is that ShouldModifyExtension returns Replace because the content type isn't known.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D151427", "files": ["uriloader/exthandler/nsExternalHelperAppService.cpp", "uriloader/exthandler/tests/mochitest/browser_save_filenames.js", "uriloader/exthandler/tests/mochitest/save_filenames.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "878beab802e6e7129556e41ed6c0ab0d390b072c", "parents": ["9ddbcae66c05d225db88d8ede7d0bb605a3c29a0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1657894550, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}, "35": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr102 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update, r=dmeehan\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D152012", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/StaticHPKPins.h", "security/manager/ssl/nsSTSPreloadList.inc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "73db4126165f2a2eded92f48a6c81c8ece6d21ce", "parents": ["878beab802e6e7129556e41ed6c0ab0d390b072c"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_102_1_0esr_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_102_1_0esr_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1658150151, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "dmeehan@mozilla.com"}}
}";